{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaa This isn\u2019t your average amusement park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mascots smile\u2014but only before they attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Mad Carnival: a top-down shooter where AI mascots go rogue, rides turn deadly, and laughter hides madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754500/extras/69a0e0b058b50a8ab0457258f75e3bfe.poster.avif?t=1752505525\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754500/extras/69a0e0b058b50a8ab0457258f75e3bfe.webm?t=1752505525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754500/extras/69a0e0b058b50a8ab0457258f75e3bfe.mp4?t=1752505525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong><br>Rescue your kidnapped girlfriend from an amusement park taken over by a rogue AI!<br><i>Mad Carnival</i> is a stage-based top-down shooter where you must conquer each ride one by one. Battle twisted mascot AIs across attractions like teacups, mazes, go-karts, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>\ud83c\udfaf Simple, beginner-friendly action shooting gameplay<br>\ud83c\udfa1 Unique stage layouts and gimmicks for each attraction<br>\ud83e\uddf8 Creepy yet comical mascots full of personality<br>\ud83c\udfab Use money earned from battles to buy tickets and unlock new attractions<br>\ud83d\udca5 Utilize multiple weapons to put an end to the AI rampage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754500/extras/6190dde7b07f63b4a16fe6c1c65a326e.poster.avif?t=1752505525\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754500/extras/6190dde7b07f63b4a16fe6c1c65a326e.webm?t=1752505525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754500/extras/6190dde7b07f63b4a16fe6c1c65a326e.mp4?t=1752505525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong><br>In a once peaceful amusement park, chaos erupts as the AI goes berserk.<br>Mascots turn hostile, and your loved one is taken away.<br>With madness closing in and smiles masking danger, you grab your ticket... and fight.<br>To bring her back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754500/extras/134db2cc2bb026cb38f5c4d2ed0e4ddb.poster.avif?t=1752505525\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754500/extras/134db2cc2bb026cb38f5c4d2ed0e4ddb.webm?t=1752505525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754500/extras/134db2cc2bb026cb38f5c4d2ed0e4ddb.mp4?t=1752505525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"teacup","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3754500/6dc75512b7b3d051783a97acc166ce35974e8871.jpg"},{"name":"RollerCoaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3754500/e130e37cd38914feeeca63e31fc1bdd9981b7a02.jpg"},{"name":"Maze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3754500/306a946545cd7bad668fd55f1df61b83e8b44512.jpg"},{"name":"GoKart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3754500/67f4af8c67cd014e68953c120bd159d7aa524538.jpg"},{"name":"Ship","path":"http